WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.780
Tang Chang'an was one of the most prosperous cities in the world at that time.

00:00:05.840 --> 00:00:12.000
Merchants, students and religious figures from many different places all came to Chang'an.

00:00:13.120 --> 00:00:20.060
In the markets you could see carpets, spices, vessels and other goods from the Western Regions.

00:00:21.160 --> 00:00:26.320
People also brought different music, dances, food and cultures.

00:00:27.660 --> 00:00:34.160
Buddhism and other religions interacted in Chang'an, and scholars learned from one another.

00:00:35.460 --> 00:00:42.540
At night the streets were bright with lights, and music and performances made the city even livelier.

00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:49.960
Chang'an was not only the capital of the Tang dynasty — it was a truly international city.
